   "text": "Steps 4\u201319 were verified end to end with scripts/test-obo.py, using an Azure CLI token with the same audience and scope as T1.\nStep 6 runs inside the gateway; it's implied by the required pre-authorization of the AI Gateway app on App B.",
   "originalText": "Steps 4\u201319 were verified end to end with scripts/test-obo.py, using an Azure CLI token with the same audience and scope as T1.\nStep 6 runs inside the gateway; it's implied by the required pre-authorization of the AI Gateway app on App B.",
